From 2cc18df1f65cfee17d01c2cc24f9c818e4a6ab3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:12:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash command hooks so provider
 commands bypass prompts

Selected chat messages that begin with strict slash commands use the backend command hook instead of ordinary prompt delivery. Providers opt into that path, and Codex maps it to raw thread resume commands so session commands such as /status run without prompt-policy wrapping.
